        "description": "<p>Choose your Command Doctrine: <strong>Street-Fixer</strong> (deals, favors, and the fixer’s web), <strong>Corp-Exec</strong> (credentials, protocol, and institutional power), or <strong>Bard</strong> (the techno-performer who moves a crowd). Each grants a skill. (<em>Quick Build:</em> Street-Fixer.)</p><p>Your doctrine is your subclass, and it determines many of the features you gain as you level.</p>",
